cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite v37-true-chart using DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23120540 from the
  beal-conjecture repository. The previous main record is
  10.5281/zenodo.23054568. The earlier foundations concept
  DOI 10.5281/zenodo.22379293 is historical.
title: "modelXtChart equivalent to D_+(Xt) via the true chart presentation — v37-true-chart"
type: software
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23120540
date-released: '2026-10-03'
authors:
  - family-names: Fox
    given-names: David
version: "v37-true-chart"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DavidFox998/beal-conjecture"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - beal-conjecture
  - lean4
  - 2-adic
  - Tate-normal-form
  - Rees-algebra
  - special-fibre
  - projective-gluing
abstract: >-
  modelXtChart is F2[a,b][X,Y,U,V] / (X·U, Y - X·V, Y^2 - X^3,
  U + X^2 + X·V^2). modelXtChart_equiv_DplusXt is
  chart_Dplus_Xt_true_presentation, a ring equivalence with D_+(Xt).
  The axiom report is propext, Classical.choice, and Quot.sound.
  The three-relation quotient without U + X^2 + X·V^2 remains
  modelRelationIdeal and is not the chart.
  chart_Dplus_Xt_presentation is D_+(Xt)/(a,b), not the full chart.
  lake build BealMathlibMissing and lake build BealEven exit 0.
  BealEven does not import the chart files. This is not a general
  Beal proof. Code tag v37-true-chart is merge 84c03d5b. DataCite
  reports 10.5281/zenodo.23120540 findable. An earlier ingest of
  that code tag, 10.5281/zenodo.23120520, copied the previous v33 title.
